1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,916
最近辫子用 Mac 电脑快一年了
I've been using a Mac for almost a year now

2
00:00:05,966 --> 00:00:12,255
发现 Mac 的空间特别容易被占满
and I've noticed its storage fills up fast

3
00:00:12,305 --> 00:00:17,103
尤其是 AI 工具多了以后
especially now that I use so many AI tools

4
00:00:17,153 --> 00:00:21,950
像飞书、Chrome 这些
apps like Feishu and Chrome

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,075
用 Mac 的朋友有没有遇到过这种情况
Have you run into this on your Mac?

6
00:00:30,125 --> 00:00:34,950
缓存特别多，但不知道怎么清
Tons of cache, and no idea how to clear it

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,863
缓存多、不知道怎么清
Lots of cache, no idea how to clean it

8
00:00:38,913 --> 00:00:43,950
我觉得这是 Mac 的通病
I think every Mac user has this problem

9
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,617
好像也没有合适的工具
There didn't seem to be a good tool for it

10
00:00:48,667 --> 00:00:53,750
所以我自己做了一个，已经开源
so I built one myself, and it's open source

11
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,950
地址放在结尾
the link is at the end

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,950
我用它扫了一下自己的电脑
I scanned my own Mac with it

13
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,950
缓存最多的三样是飞书、Chrome 和微信
the three biggest caches: Feishu, Chrome and WeChat

14
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,950
硬盘剩下的空间已经不到 80G 了
I have less than 80 GB of free space left

15
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:17,188
它们其实都不是聊天记录
None of it is chat history

16
00:01:17,238 --> 00:01:21,950
只是存在电脑上的缓存
it's just cache stored on my Mac

17
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:26,950
存了从来不删，就越积越多
It's saved and never removed, so it keeps piling up

18
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:32,617
于是我做了一个工具，叫 MacSweeper
So I made a tool called MacSweeper

19
00:01:32,667 --> 00:01:34,950
一个 Mac 清理工具
a cleaner for Mac

20
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,053
它从来不直接删除东西
It never deletes anything directly

21
00:01:38,103 --> 00:01:43,950
因为大家用 Mac，图的就是安全、简单
because people choose a Mac for being safe and simple

22
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,450
Mac 没有自带垃圾清理工具
macOS doesn't come with a junk cleaner

23
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:51,950
我设计的时候，也不希望它直接帮我删掉
and I didn't want mine deleting things for me

24
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,888
我觉得这是 AI 时代需要防范的一点
I think this is something to guard against in the AI era

25
00:01:55,938 --> 00:01:58,950
AI 很聪明，随时可以帮你删
AI is smart enough to delete things for you anytime

26
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:03,950
但我恰恰不能让它随时帮我删
and that's exactly what I don't want it to do

27
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:08,394
它会先把要清理的内容放进废纸篓
It moves everything to the Trash first

28
00:02:08,444 --> 00:02:11,950
你觉得没问题，再自己清空
and you empty it only when you're sure

29
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:19,632
现在市面上找不到这样的工具
I couldn't find a tool like this

30
00:02:19,682 --> 00:02:24,950
所以我自己做了一个
so I made one myself

31
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,790
大家可以看一下，我设计了两个模式
As you can see, there are two modes

32
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,950
简单模式和详细模式
Simple Mode and Detailed Mode

33
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:37,950
简单模式适合新手，打开就能用
Simple Mode is for beginners: open it and go

34
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:41,200
详细模式里每一项都有说明卡
Detailed Mode has an info card for every item

35
00:02:41,250 --> 00:02:45,950
卸载 App 时会连同缓存和设置一起清
uninstalling an app removes its caches and settings too

36
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:49,950
还有空间地图，用色块看谁占了空间
and the Space Map shows what's taking up room

37
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:54,998
我还专门做了 AI 工具这一项
I also added a section just for AI tools

38
00:02:55,048 --> 00:03:00,934
比如我主要用的 Claude 和 Codex
like Claude and Codex, which I use most

39
00:03:00,984 --> 00:03:03,633
它们留下了很多旧对话
they leave behind lots of old conversations

40
00:03:03,683 --> 00:03:07,950
现在看已经没那么重要，也可以清掉
many don't matter anymore and can be cleared

41
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:14,247
这个工具不联网，不是流氓软件
It doesn't go online, and it's not shady software

42
00:03:14,297 --> 00:03:18,409
免费开源，MIT 协议
free and open source, MIT licensed

43
00:03:18,459 --> 00:03:25,599
Apple 芯片和 Intel 都能用
works on Apple silicon and Intel

44
00:03:25,649 --> 00:03:32,788
后面我还会继续更新，支持浅色和深色模式
I'll keep improving it; it has light and dark mode

45
00:03:32,838 --> 00:03:36,950
大家可以在这个网站下载
you can download it from this site

46
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:42,436
我还没买苹果开发者签名，之后会买
I haven't bought an Apple developer certificate yet, but I will

47
00:03:42,486 --> 00:03:48,950
现在下载的话，第一次打开要先点“完成”
for now, click “Done” the first time you open it

48
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:55,426
关于这个项目有任何问题，欢迎私信我
Any questions, feel free to DM me

49
00:03:55,476 --> 00:04:01,140
也欢迎在 GitHub 上留言
or leave a comment on GitHub

50
00:04:01,190 --> 00:04:06,855
我是辫子，在泰国曼谷做 MCN
I'm Bianzi, I work at an MCN in Bangkok, Thailand

51
00:04:06,905 --> 00:04:11,426
一直在 AI 项目上投入
and I keep building AI projects

52
00:04:11,476 --> 00:04:12,950
感谢观看
thanks for watching
